          <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-white mb-4">The Bottom Line</h2>
          <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
            Paddle weight shapes how every shot feels, but the number on the scale is only part of it. Light paddles favour quick hands, heavy paddles favour power, and midweight paddles around 8 ounces suit most players. Swing weight and balance decide how that weight feels in motion, and grip size decides how hard you have to squeeze to control it.
          </p>
